{"s":81,"v":[{"t":"When the sun is wrapped up [in darkness]","w":[["إِذَا","When","idhā",""],["ٱلشَّمْسُ","the sun","l-shamsu","",[["ٱل",2],["شَّمْسُ",354]]],["كُوِّرَتْ","is wrapped up","kuwwirat",""]]},{"t":"And when the stars fall, dispersing,","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["ٱلنُّجُومُ","the stars","l-nujūmu","",[["ٱل",2],["نُّجُومُ",696]]],["ٱنكَدَرَتْ","fall, losing their luster","inkadarat",""]]},{"t":"And when the mountains are removed","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["ٱلْجِبَالُ","the mountains","l-jibālu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["جِبَالُ",313]]],["سُيِّرَتْ","are moved away","suyyirat",""]]},{"t":"And when full-term she-camels are neglected","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["ٱلْعِشَارُ","the full-term she-camels","l-ʿishāru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عِشَارُ",3895]]],["عُطِّلَتْ","(are) left untended","ʿuṭṭilat",""]]},{"t":"And when the wild beasts are gathered","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["ٱلْوُحُوشُ","the wild beasts","l-wuḥūshu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["وُحُوشُ",4644]]],["حُشِرَتْ","are gathered","ḥushirat",""]]},{"t":"And when the seas are filled with flame","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["ٱلْبِحَارُ","the seas","l-biḥāru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["بِحَارُ",292]]],["سُجِّرَتْ","are made to overflow","sujjirat",""]]},{"t":"And when the souls are paired","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["ٱلنُّفُوسُ","the souls","l-nufūsu","",[["ٱل",2],["نُّفُوسُ",51]]],["زُوِّجَتْ","are paired","zuwwijat",""]]},{"t":"And when the girl [who was] buried alive is asked","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["ٱلْمَوْءُۥدَةُ","the female infant buried alive","l-mawūdatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَوْءُۥدَةُ",4255]]],["سُئِلَتْ","is asked","su-ilat",""]]},{"t":"For what sin she was killed","w":[["بِأَىِّ","For what","bi-ayyi","",[["بِ",10],["أَىِّ",71]]],["ذَنۢبٍۢ","sin","dhanbin",""],["قُتِ