athes","tanaffasa",""]]},{"t":"[That] indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a word [conveyed by] a noble messenger [i.e., Gabriel]","w":[["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed, it","innahu","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هُۥ",5]]],["لَقَوْلُ","(is) surely a word","laqawlu","",[["لَ",23],["قَوْلُ",137]]],["رَسُولٍۢ","(of) a Messenger","rasūlin",""],["كَرِيمٍۢ","noble","karīmin",""]]},{"t":"[Who is] possessed of power and with the Owner of the Throne, secure [in position],","w":[["ذِى","Possessor of","dhī",""],["قُوَّةٍ","power","quwwatin",""],["عِندَ","with","ʿinda",""],["ذِى","(the) Owner of","dhī",""],["ٱلْعَرْشِ","the Throne","l-ʿarshi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَرْشِ",388]]],["مَكِينٍۢ","secure","makīnin",""]]},{"t":"Obeyed there [in the heavens] and trustworthy.","w":[["مُّطَاعٍۢ","One to be obeyed","muṭāʿin",""],["ثَمَّ","and","thamma",""],["أَمِينٍۢ","trustworthy","amīnin",""]]},{"t":"And your companion [i.e., Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ) ] is not [at all] mad.","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["صَاحِبُكُم","(is) your companion","ṣāḥibukum","",[["صَاحِبُ",729],["كُم",4]]],["بِمَجْنُونٍۢ","mad","bimajnūnin","",[["بِ",10],["مَجْنُونٍۢ",789]]]]},{"t":"And he has already seen him [i.e., Gabriel] in the clear horizon.","w":[["وَلَقَدْ","And certainly","walaqad","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",23],["قَدْ",37]]],["رَءَاهُ","he saw him","raāhu","",[["رَءَا",60],["هُ",5]]],["بِٱلْأُفُقِ","in the horizon","bil-ufuqi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["أُفُقِ",1729]]],["ٱلْمُبِينِ","the clear","l-mubīni","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُبِينِ",117]]]]},{"t":"And he [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] is not a withholder of [knowledge of] the unseen.","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["هُوَ","he (is)","huwa",""],["عَلَى","on","ʿalā",""],["ٱلْغَيْبِ","the unseen","l-ghaybi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["غَيْبِ",251]]],["بِضَنِينٍۢ","a withholder","biḍanīnin","",[["بِ",10],["ضَنِينٍۢ",3801]]]]},{"t":"And it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens].","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["هُوَ","it","huwa",""],["بِقَوْلِ","(is the) word","biqawli","",[["بِ",10],["قَوْلِ",137]]],["شَيْطَـٰنٍۢ","(of) Shaitaan","shayṭānin",""],["رَّجِيمٍۢ","accursed","rajīmin",""]]},{"t":"So where are you going?","w":[["فَأَيْنَ","So where","fa-ayna","",[["فَ",7],["أَيْنَ",520]]],["تَذْهَبُونَ","are you going","tadhhabūna","",[["تَذْهَبُ",342],["ونَ",4]]]]},{"t":"It is not except a reminder to the worlds","w":[["إِنْ","Not","in",""],["هُوَ","it","huwa",""],["إِلَّا","(is) except","illā",""],["ذِكْرٌۭ","a reminder","dhik'run",""],["لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","to the worlds","lil'ʿālamīna","",[["لِّ",8],["لْ",2],["عَـٰلَمِينَ",174]]]]},{"t":"For whoever wills among you to take a right course.","w":[["لِمَن","For whoever","liman","",[["لِ",8],["مَن",25]]],["شَآءَ","wills","shāa",""],["مِنكُمْ","among you","minkum","",[["مِن",6],["كُمْ",4]]],["أَن","to","an",""],["يَسْتَقِيمَ","take a straight way","yastaqīma",""]]},{"t":"And you do not will except that Allāh wills - Lord of the worlds.","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["تَشَآءُونَ","you will","tashāūna","",[["تَشَآءُ",68],["ونَ",4]]],["إِلَّآ","except","illā",""],["أَن","that","an",""],["يَشَآءَ","wills","yashāa",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["رَبُّ","Lord","rabbu",""],["ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","(of) the worlds","l-ʿālamīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَـٰلَمِينَ",174]]]]}]}